3. Show your enthusiasm and passion: Employers want to hire people who are enthusiastic and passionate about their work. Use your cover letter to demonstrate your excitement for the company and the industry.
4. Keep it concise and focused: Your cover letter should be no more than one page and should focus on the most important information. Avoid repeating information that is already on your resume.
